## Automatic pagination

When configured, collection operations expose lazy paginator and collect helpers.
They use the service pagination convention and per-operation overrides, including
starting page/offset, default/maximum page size, and the termination rule. All
filters and headers are retained. Collection fails if any page fails; use lazy
paging for incremental processing and early stopping.

Use `operation_paginator(...)` with `for` (sync) or `async for` (async). Each page is a typed item list. Use `operation_collect(...)` to collect everything, awaiting it on async clients.
